      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/German%20Larrea%20Mota-Velasco\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">German Larrea Mota-Velasco</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 1999 December)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman of the Board</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman of the Board since December 1999. Chief Executive Officer of Grupo Mexico (holding company) since 1994 and Chairman of the Board of Directors of Grupo Mexico since 1994. Chairman of the Board of Directors and CEO of Grupo Ferroviario Mexicano, S.A. de C.V. and Chairman of the Board of Directors and CEO of Ferrocarril Mexicano, S.A. de C.V. since 1997.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Oscar%20Gonzalez%20Rocha\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Oscar Gonzalez Rocha</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 1999 December)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President since December 1999 and Chief Executive Officer since October 2004. Director since November 1999. Director and Chief Executive Officer of Americas Mining Corporation since 2002. Director and President of Grupo Mexico since 2002.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Raul%20Jacob\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Raul Jacob</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2013 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, Finance and Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Vice President, Finance and Chief Financial Officer since April 2013. Previously served as Director of Investor Relations from 2000 to 2013.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Xavier%20Garcia%20de%20Quevedo%20Topete\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Xavier Garcia de Quevedo Topete</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2014 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice Chairman of the Board</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Vice Chairman of the Board since 2014. Director since 1999. Previously served as President of Minera Mexico from 2001 to 2014.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/German%20Larrea%20Mota-Velasco\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">German Larrea Mota-Velasco</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 1999 December)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman of the Board</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman of the Board of the Company since December 1999. Chairman of the Board of Directors and CEO of Grupo Mexico since 1994.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Oscar%20Gonzalez%20Rocha\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Oscar Gonzalez Rocha</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 1999 November)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President and CEO of the Company. Director since 1999.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Vicente%20Ariztegui%20Andreve\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Vicente Ariztegui Andreve</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2014 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Director since 2014. President and CEO of Ariztegui y Asociados, S.C. and Managing Director of Onis Vida, S.A. de C.V.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Enrique%20Castillo%20Sanchez%20Mejorada\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Enrique Castillo Sanchez Mejorada</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2010 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Director since 2010. Chairman of the Board of Maxcom Telecomunicaciones, S.A.B. de C.V. and Non-executive Chairman of the Board of Banco Nacional de Mexico, S.A.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Leonardo%20Contreras%20Lerdo%20de%20Tejada\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Leonardo Contreras Lerdo de Tejada</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2014 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Director since 2014. Vice President of Administration of Grupo Mexico since 2014.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Xavier%20Garcia%20de%20Quevedo%20Topete\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Xavier Garcia de Quevedo Topete</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 1999 November)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice Chairman of the Board</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Director since 1999. Vice Chairman of the Board since 2014.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Daniel%20Mu%C3%B1iz%20Quintanilla\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Daniel Muñiz Quintanilla</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2008 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Director since 2008. Former CEO of the Mining Division of Grupo Mexico.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Luis%20Miguel%20Palomino%20Bonilla\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Luis Miguel Palomino Bonilla</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2004 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Director since 2004. Chairman of the Board of Directors of the Peruvian Institute of Economics and Director of the Central Reserve Bank of Peru.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gilberto%20Perezalonso%20Cifuentes\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gilberto Perezalonso Cifuentes</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2002 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Director since 2002. Former CEO of Aeromexico and former CFO of Grupo Televisa.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Carlos%20Ruiz%20Sacristan\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Carlos Ruiz Sacristan</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2004 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Director since 2004. Chairman of the Board of Sempra Infrastructure and former Secretary of Communications and Transportation of Mexico.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/100183/000110465924037568/tm244304d1_def14a.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Southern Copper Corporation DEF 14A Proxy Statement</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-03-22)</span></li></ul>"
